Icons and Artwork
-----------------

Room Tunes bundles application icons, window-control icons, media-control
icons, and other UI artwork.  Some icons are original Room Tunes artwork;
some are adapted from external open-source icon sets or public icon sources.

Known or likely upstream icon sources include:

  Material Design Icons
  https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/

  Bootstrap Icons
  https://icons.getbootstrap.com/

  GNOME / Adwaita icon artwork
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme

The bundled icon files may have been resized, recolored, simplified, or
otherwise adapted for Room Tunes' UI.  Their original projects retain their
respective copyrights and license terms.
